.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-zfg9ap/TASK-260715-zfg9ap_rework-01.md:1:Rework round 1 must consume TASK-260715-zfg9ap_review-verdict.md and the attached 20-run churn probe. Close every finding without weakening the accepted non-blocking bounded diagnostics contract. The authoritative registry and all exported current-state gauges must converge to exact baseline even when the bounded diagnostics queue drops intermediate events; do not make packet or SSH executors wait, do not make the queue unbounded, and do not mask divergence only in tests. Preserve monotonic aggregate counters with explicit semantics under dropped ingestion, and retain the diagnostics ingestion-drop signal. Make every reservation identifier allocation fail closed before UInt64 wrap can reuse a live or retired ID; prove no ABA, silent replacement, or leaked capacity at exhaustion. Add deterministic coverage for concurrent explicit release versus deinit, duplicate finish/release, late and stale generation callbacks, session-health transitions racing admission, queued-byte sum overflow or saturation, and sustained pressure where admitted flows progress while rejected arrivals create neither side queues nor SSH opens. Re-run the independent churn reproducer enough times to show both registry and exported gauges return to exact baseline, plus focused normal and TSan suites, full validate-core, strict format, boundary/privacy guards, diff check, and board validate. Update task-scoped outcome evidence and route to to-review; stop only if a clean bounded non-blocking reconciliation design is impossible and attach full constraint evidence.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-zfg9ap/TASK-260715-zfg9ap_accepted-inputs.md:1:Execution brief from the accepted critical path. Consume TASK-260715-1juybj_contract.md sections 6 and 10 for atomic non-waiting reservations, admission ordering, SOCKS failure mapping, accounting equations, finite terminal reasons, and privacy exclusions. Consume accepted TASK-260715-1i49fm diagnostics APIs and schemas; extend them without destination, hostname, address, port, payload, credential, or high-cardinality labels. Compose cleanly with TASK-260715-sdnk2k bounded pump but do not implement downstream terminal lifecycle TASK-260715-1n9v9o. Preserve the goal invariant that final flow, opening, and byte ceilings remain injectable evidence gates: validate policy and prove bounded behavior, but do not hardcode final physical-tuning values. No SSH-engine selection or engine-specific imports. Exercise below, at, and above all independent limits, concurrent reserve/release races, every terminal cleanup path, fairness of already-admitted flows, deterministic immediate rejects with no side queue or SSH open, diagnostics generation reset, and return to exact baseline under churn. Run focused tests, TSan for concurrent accounting, full core validation, strict format, boundary/privacy guards, and task-board validation. Record exact commands and measured evidence in a task-scoped outcome resource; stop only for an evidence-backed platform or architecture conflict, never a workaround.
